    {
     "_key": "000000000011",
     "_type": "block",
     "children": [
      {
       "_key": "000000000004",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": "Begin your adventure in the sun-drenched town of "
      },
      {
       "_key": "000000000006",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [
        "000000000005"
       ],
       "text": "Aswan"
      },
      {
       "_key": "000000000007",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": ". Ascend the towering 364ft. High Dam to behold a breathtaking panorama of the city. Unveil the mysteries of the Unfinished Obelisk, then step aboard a "
      },
      {
       "_key": "000000000009",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [
        "000000000008"
       ],
       "text": "luxurious Nile Cruise"
      },
      {
       "_key": "00000000000a",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": ". Let the serene waters carry you to "
      },
      {
       "_key": "00000000000c",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [
        "00000000000b"
       ],
       "text": "Kom Ombo"
      },
      {
       "_key": "00000000000d",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": ", home to a temple honoring the gods of crocodile and falcon. Sail onwards to "
      },
      {
       "_key": "00000000000f",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [
        "00000000000e"
       ],
       "text": "Edfu"
      },
      {
       "_key": "tuonp9vdc1h8",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": ", where the Temple of Horus awaits, and complete your journey in "
      },
      {
       "_key": "sybdh8tbpyys",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [
        "otk11tiipxgv"
       ],
       "text": "Luxor"
      },
      {
       "_key": "xr2oobtf452g",
