    {
     "_key": "000000000024",
     "_type": "block",
     "children": [
      {
       "_key": "000000000014",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": "Immerse yourself in the enchantment of Luxor. Wander through the sprawling "
      },
      {
       "_key": "000000000016",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [
        "000000000015"
       ],
       "text": "Karnak Temple"
      },
      {
       "_key": "000000000017",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": " complex, spanning 200 acres, and experience the city’s heartbeat on a horse-drawn carriage to the Luxor Temple. Explore the hallowed Valley of the Kings, the majestic Temple of Hatshepsut, and the towering "
      },
      {
       "_key": "000000000019",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [
        "000000000018"
       ],
       "text": "Colossi of Memnon"
      },
      {
       "_key": "00000000001a",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": ". Set sail on an unforgettable Nile journey, stopping at the storied "
      },
      {
       "_key": "00000000001c",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [
        "00000000001b"
       ],
       "text": "temples of Edfu and Kom Ombo"
      },
      {
       "_key": "dwokurtc8b1x",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": ". In "
      },
      {
       "_key": "klud8ueb6mee",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [
        "qk8ynnhyuy84"
       ],
       "text": "Aswan"
      },
      {
       "_key": "klf03s77t1v0",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": ", pay homage at the "
      },
      {
       "_key": "00000000001f",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [
        "00000000001e"
       ],
       "text": "Philae Temple"
      },
      {
       "_key": "000000000020",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": ", dedicated to Isis, and marvel at the High Dam and the Unfinished Obelisk. "
      },
      {
       "_key": "000000000022",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [
        "000000000021"
       ],
       "text": "A five-day tour"
      },
      {
       "_key": "000000000023",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": " of discovery awaits."
