       "marks": [
        "00000000002c"
       ],
       "text": "El Kab"
      },
      {
       "_key": "00000000002e",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": " and the ruins of Nekhen, the capital of Upper Egypt in antiquity. Proceed to "
